# Exception: the paired clean-vs-sliding analysis artifacts are research
# evidence, not regenerable output. clean_baseline_alignment.json in
# particular cannot be rebuilt without the checkpoint, which is not in the
# repository, and tests/test_paired_comparison.py reads these files. Scoped to
# this one directory; every other path under outputs/ stays ignored. Placed
# last so it also overrides the *.csv rule above.
!outputs/temporal_risk/
!outputs/temporal_risk/paired_clean_vs_sliding_window/
!outputs/temporal_risk/paired_clean_vs_sliding_window/**
